Trading Checklist

[ ] Is this one of my approved setups?
[ ] Is the 4h/1h market condition clear?
[ ] Am I entering at a meaningful level?
[ ] Is there confirmation on the setup timeframe?
[ ] Is my stop based on invalidation—not an arbitrary percentage?
[ ] Is risk 0.5% or less?
[ ] Is the target realistic before the next obstacle?
[ ] Are fees and slippage included?
[ ] Is the order using isolated margin?
[ ] Is the stop-loss ready?
[ ] Am I calm and not chasing?